			"date": "2022-12-28T16:58:03.610Z",
			"content": "<p><span class=\"h-card\" translate=\"no\"><a href=\"https://indieweb.social/@mehulkar\" class=\"u-url mention\">@<span>mehulkar</span></a></span> hmmm, I wouldn’t use *the answer* but hooking a bundler to this API is one answer to that question, yeah!</p>",
